# Block texture location

- When adding or updating Minecraft block textures, use files from `public/assets/minecraft/textures/block`.
- Treat `public/assets/minecraft/textures/block` as the canonical location for block texture assets.
- If code references block textures, prefer paths that resolve to assets under this directory.
